Type: Package
Package: openalexPro
Title: Providing a more advanced access to OpenAlex for the power user
Version: 0.13.0
Author: Rainer M Krug
Maintainer: Rainer M Krug <Rainer@krugs.de>
Description: Retrieves large result sets from the 'OpenAlex' API
    (<https://openalex.org>) without holding them in memory. Queries are
    built and validated with classic filters and search, or written in
    'OpenAlex' query language (OQL) or its JSON form (OQO). Results are
    downloaded page by page to JSON files, with cursor paging, parallel
    downloads, retries and resume, and converted per page with 'DuckDB' to a
    partitioned 'Apache Parquet' dataset that includes reconstructed
    abstracts and citation strings. Full-text PDFs and TEI XML can be
    downloaded, and the daily API budget can be inspected.
URL: https://github.com/openalexPro/openalexPro, https://openalexpro.github.io/openalexPro/, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17453180
BugReports: https://github.com/openalexPro/openalexPro/issues
